# Local secrets for `npm run dev` / `wrangler dev`.
# Copy this file to .dev.vars (which git ignores) and fill in real values.
# In production, set each one with: npx wrangler secret put <NAME>
#
# None are needed yet. They arrive with their features:

# Better Auth (auth feature) — generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=
# BETTER_AUTH_URL=http://localhost:4321

# Stripe (payments feature)
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Resend (email feature)
# RESEND_API_KEY=
